  "id": "wcst",
  "term": "WCST",
  "definition": "WCST stands for the Wisconsin Card Sorting Test, a psychological test used to detect executive functioning problems, especially difficulties with cognitive flexibility and planning. It can highlight patterns such as perseverative responding, where a person keeps using the same approach despite changing demands.",
